<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="vi">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>cpuchecker - Hệ Thống Giám Sát Phần Cứng</title>
    <style>
        body { font-family: 'Segoe UI', sans-serif; background-color: #0f172a; color: #f8fafc; text-align: center; padding: 60px 20px; }
        .container { max-width: 800px; margin: 0 auto; }
        h1 { color: #38bdf8; font-size: 2.5rem; }
        .subtitle { color: #94a3b8; font-size: 1.2rem; margin-bottom: 50px; }
        .download-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(220px, 1fr)); gap: 25px; }
        .download-card { background-color: #1e293b; border: 2px solid #334155; border-radius: 16px; padding: 30px 20px; text-decoration: none; color: white; display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; }
        .download-card:hover { border-color: #38bdf8; transform: translateY(-5px); }
        .os-icon { font-size: 3rem; margin-bottom: 15px; }
        .os-name { font-size: 1.4rem; font-weight: bold; margin-bottom: 8px; }
        .file-info { font-size: 0.9rem; color: #38bdf8; font-family: monospace; background-color: #0f172a; padding: 4px 12px; border-radius: 20px; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="container">
        <h1>cpuchecker</h1>
        <p class="subtitle">Ứng dụng giám sát phần cứng máy tính thời gian thực siêu mượt, phong cách CPU-Z.</p>
        <div class="download-grid">
            <a href="cpuchecker.exe" class="download-card">
                <div class="os-icon">🪟</div>
                <div class="os-name">Windows</div>
                <div class="file-info">cpuchecker.exe</div>
            </a>
            <a href="cpuchecker.dmg" class="download-card">
                <div class="os-icon">🍎</div>
                <div class="os-name">macOS</div>
                <div class="file-info">cpuchecker.dmg</div>
            </a>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
